---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { url } from '../lib/url';
---

<Base title="About" description="Who made First Moves, what it is based on, and how it is licensed.">
  <div class="wrap prose">
    <h1>About First Moves</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      First Moves is a free, hands-on course for people who just got an Ableton Move and are new to making music.
    </p>

    <h2>Unofficial</h2>
    <p>
      This site is <strong>not affiliated with or endorsed by Ableton AG</strong>. Ableton, Move, Live, Push and Note
      are trademarks of Ableton AG. The lessons are written from scratch and the drawings are our own; nothing here is
      copied from Ableton’s manual or tutorials.
    </p>

    <h2>What it’s based on</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="https://www.ableton.com/en/move/manual/">The official Move manual</a> (written for Move software 1.x).</li>
      <li>
        <a href="https://www.ableton.com/en/release-notes/move-1/">Ableton’s Move release notes</a>, for features added
        in Move software 2.0 and 2.1.
      </li>
      <li><a href="https://help.ableton.com/hc/en-us/categories/15835956341660-Move">Ableton’s Move help articles</a>.</li>
      <li>
        <a href="https://www.ableton.com/move/learn-move/">Ableton’s Learn Move videos</a>, which lessons link to where
        they fit.
      </li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      The course is written for <strong>Move software 2.1</strong>. When a lesson relies on something newer than the
      manual, it says so. If a step doesn’t match what your Move does, trust your Move, and check the official manual.
    </p>

    <h2>Your progress</h2>
    <p>
      Progress is stored only in this browser (local storage). There are no accounts, no tracking, and nothing is sent
      anywhere. You can reset it from the <a href={url('course/')}>course map</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>License</h2>
    <p>
      Lesson text and drawings: <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/">CC BY 4.0</a>. Code: MIT. Source
      on <a href="https://github.com/ManMan88/first-moves">GitHub</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>
